# Copy to .env and fill in your key. .env is gitignored.
#
# IMPORTANT: this name must NOT start with VITE_.
# Vite inlines every import.meta.env.VITE_* value into the public JS bundle at
# build time, so a VITE_-prefixed key would be readable by anyone who opens
# devtools on the deployed site. This key is read only in Node — by the Vercel
# Function in api/gemini.ts, and by the local dev proxy in vite.config.ts.
#
# In production, set this in Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
GEMINI_API_KEY= 

# Leave unset to run without AI. The app still works: it serves the 10 bundled
# lessons and the full quiz flow, and AI calls fail closed rather than breaking.
